{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53787","headline":"戏酬皇甫十再劝酒 · 白居易","name":"戏酬皇甫十再劝酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"净名居士眼方丈，玄晏先生酿老春。\n手把屈巵未（疑应作「来」）劝我，世间何处觅波旬？\n（前二句见《千载佳句》卷上《人事部·闲放》後二句见卷下《宴喜部·酒》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}